ulate the disassembly of focal adhesions. Did not bind receptor-like tyrosine phosphatases type 2A."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}